# Play case chat (parity with Differentials)

## Patient mode (stethoscope)

Play must match Differential floating chat:

| Control | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Stethoscope toggle | `SceneOrderCommandDock` header + `CaseSessionThread` when `onPatientModeChange` set |
| State | `chatPatientMode` + `chatPatientModeRef` in `Play.jsx` — reset on `caseData.id` change |
| Off (default) | Order dock + voice → **tutor** (`chatMode: 'tutor'`) |
| On (gold) | → **patient_sim** |
| Slash | `/pt` patient · `/ch` tutor/notes — `parseChatModeCommand` in dock + thread |

Thread default in Play: `defaultChatTarget="tutor"` (not notes-only).

## Chat session expired

Server keeps sessions **in RAM only** (`caseChatSessions` in `server/index.js`). Lost on API restart (~every `npm run dev`) or **2h** idle.

**Do not** tell Steve to "close chat" as the only fix. Client must auto-recover:

- `sendCaseChatMessage(..., recover: { caseData, chatMode })` → clear client cache → `/api/case-chat/start` → retry once.
- Persisted UI history stays in localStorage; only server LLM window is new.

When adding new chat send paths, always pass `recover` or call `ensureCaseChatSession` after 404.

## Order · Chat dock

Non-order text → chat (not "Answer in chat →" dead end). Matcher: `orderCommandAutocomplete.js` synonym rings for common labs/exam phrases.

Chat markdown: `*italic*` stage directions via `chatMessageFormat.jsx` — not raw asterisks.
